Add `shared.generate` to determine if a shared file needs to be generated on the remote side.
``` js
shared: {
  vue: {
    generate: false
  }
}
```
When the above configuration is used, the shared chunk is not generated on the remote side

Refactoring the polymorphism package -> changed 'Comida.java'  to an abstract class;
Adding the exercises about abstract classes;
Refactoring the inheritance challenge -> added interfaces;
